  partName: Clip
  description: The Clip, located at the middle-center-rear of the engine, is a tiny,
    thin-flat, plastic-grey component that secures and retains other parts in place.
    Its small size and thin shape allow it to fit in tight spaces, while its plastic-grey
    material provides sufficient flexibility and durability. Notably, the Clip's
    position at the rear of the engine enables it to work in conjunction with other
    components to maintain engine stability and performance.
